# apply order inside pipeline-platform (L3 + ops)  (destroy = reverse). Format: `a | b` = same group (parallel ok); # = comment.
# ENV=_shared carries kms, ecr, private-ca — apply it BEFORE any environment.
kms
secrets
ssm-contract
iam-roles
s3
ecr
private-ca
rds-aurora | dynamodb | msk | efs | messaging-sqs-sns | aurora-global | rds-mysql   # data tier: independent of each other
eks-cluster
eks-irsa             # needs the cluster's OIDC issuer — NEVER before eks-cluster
eks-nodes
eks-managed-addons
backup               # ops
observability-alarms # ops
